<title>AUSTRALIA: BHP NAMES NEW FINANCE HEAD FOR OIL UNIT.</title>
<headline>BHP NAMES NEW FINANCE HEAD FOR OIL UNIT.</headline>
<dateline>MELBOURNE 1997-08-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Broken Hill Pty Co Ltd said on Tuesday it had appointed Tim Knott to the position of group general manager finance and administration for BHP Petroleum.</p>
<p>Knott was formerly BHP's corporate treasurer. The acting head of BHP Petroleum, Philip Aiken said in a statement that Knott was well known to the investment and financial communities and has extensive experience within the company.</p>
<p>-- Melbourne Bureau 61-3 9286-1435</p>
